Bugatti Tourbillon 2026 - Low-Poly 3D Model

MODEL SPECIFICATIONS:

High-quality low-poly 3D model based on real-scale dimensions;

Optimized for real-time rendering, games, and VR/AR applications;

Original dimensions and accurate proportions;

All objects have correct unique names;

All materials have correct unique names;

All objects are placed in their respective layers;

No NGon polygons on model;

Geometry is primarily Triangles and Quads (optimized for game engines);

Model includes a simple low-poly interior;

Pivot points are correctly placed for easy animation (wheels, doors).

MATERIALS AND UV:

Fully UV Mapped: Non-overlapping UVs for main parts;

PBR Materials / Standard Materials setup;

All parts have materials assigned;

All formats include necessary textures;

Model is ready to drop into game engines (Unity, Unreal) or renderers.
